# Benchmark: strings
# Workload: 100 rounds of building, changing case, replacing, splitting and
# joining text. Measures text operations.

message is "Hello Otter benchmark"
built is ""
count from 1 to 100 as n
    upper is uppercase of message
    lower is lowercase of message
    replaced is message
    replace "Otter" with "World" in replaced
    split replaced by " " into parts
    join parts with "-" into joined
    built is joined
.
say "strings" built length of built
